{"seq":3,"slug":"time-window-cold-proof-delivery","title":"时效窗/预约与温控签收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/cold-customs-lastmile/time-window-cold-proof-delivery","wordCount":2168,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"时效窗-预约与温控签收\">时效窗/预约与温控签收</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生鲜配送有一个标品没有的约束：<strong>交付时间的质量与交付本身同等重要</strong>。一箱 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的鲜奶如果在门口等了六小时，物理上&quot;送达&quot;了，商业上失败了。因此冷链的交付设计要把&quot;时间&quot;变成<strong>可承诺、可验证、可追责</strong>的三样东西：时效窗是承诺，预约是履约机制，温控签收是验证。</p>\n<p>这三者构成一条链：时效窗定义了&quot;必须在多久内完成&quot;，预约把&quot;多久&quot;变成&quot;哪个具体时段&quot;，温控签收则是&quot;完成后如何证明温度没坏&quot;。任何一环缺失，交付的质量就无法被证明。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单生成] --&gt; B[估算可用配送时长&lt;br/&gt;保温预算]&#10;  B --&gt; C[生成时效窗]&#10;  C --&gt; D[客户选择预约时段]&#10;  D --&gt; E[排班/路由]&#10;  E --&gt; F{到达时段可行?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[重新报价时效窗]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[配送]&#10;  H --&gt; I[签收: 温度采集]&#10;  I --&gt; J{温度合格?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[交付完成]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[拒收/定责]\">graph TD\n  A[订单生成] --&gt; B[估算可用配送时长&lt;br/&gt;保温预算]\n  B --&gt; C[生成时效窗]\n  C --&gt; D[客户选择预约时段]\n  D --&gt; E[排班/路由]\n  E --&gt; F{到达时段可行?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[重新报价时效窗]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[配送]\n  H --&gt; I[签收: 温度采集]\n  I --&gt; J{温度合格?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[交付完成]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[拒收/定责]</pre><h2 id=\"时效窗的生成逻辑\">时效窗的生成逻辑</h2><h3 id=\"时效窗不是营销口径-是物理约束\">时效窗不是营销口径，是物理约束</h3><p>普通电商的时效窗（&quot;次日达&quot;、&quot;上午送达&quot;）来自运力与成本权衡；冷链的时效窗还多了一层<strong>硬约束</strong>：它不能超过保温系统的可用时长。可用配送时长由保温模型反解得出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max} = -\\frac{1}{k}\\ln\\frac{T_{env} - T_{alarm}}{T_{env} - T_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（推导与各参数含义见 <a href=\"local-cold-warehouse-turnover\">本地冷库周转与尾程保温</a>）。如果一个区域、一个季节、一种箱体算出来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只有 10 小时，那么承诺 24 小时送达在物理上就是不可兑现的。因此时效窗必须<strong>按季节、按区域、按箱体分档计算</strong>，而不是全站统一写一个数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三档时效窗与成本阶梯\">三档时效窗与成本阶梯</h3><p>把时效窗分档能让客户在&quot;为速度付费&quot;和&quot;接受较长时效&quot;之间选择，这对冷链尤其有效，因为延长时效需要更强的保温方案、成本更高：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n<th>保温方案</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极速</td>\n<td>2–4 小时</td>\n<td>基础保温箱</td>\n<td>最高（运力密集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>当日/次日</td>\n<td>标准保温箱 + 相变冷媒</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽松</td>\n<td>24–48 小时</td>\n<td>加强保温 + 干冰</td>\n<td>低（运力宽松）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意这里的成本结构是反直觉的：<strong>越快越贵</strong>，因为快意味着更密集的运力占用；而慢件可以合并路线、用更大的时间窗换更低的单位运力成本。这与标品电商的&quot;慢件便宜&quot;方向一致，但冷链的差异在于慢件必须配更强的保温方案，部分抵消了运力成本的节省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预约机制的作用\">预约机制的作用</h2><h3 id=\"预约解决的三个问题\">预约解决的三个问题</h3><p><strong>配送失败</strong>。无人在家是尾程超温的主要来源。预约把&quot;我什么时候来&quot;与&quot;你什么时候在&quot;对齐，直接降低失败率。</p>\n<p><strong>月台与人力调度</strong>。对 B 端客户（餐厅、商超），预约是<strong>卸货资源的协调</strong>——冷库月台有限，同时到货会造成排队等待，而排队意味着车辆保持制冷的能耗与货物暴露风险。预约把到货时间均匀化。</p>\n<p><strong>温度预算的可预测性</strong>。有预约的订单，其&quot;从出库到签收&quot;的时长是已知的，可以直接与可用配送时长比较并提前判断可行性；无预约的订单只能按最坏情况估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时段粒度与调度代价\">时段粒度与调度代价</h3><p>时段越细，客户体验越好，但调度的灵活性越低、成本越高。常见粒度是 2–4 小时。粒度过细（如 30 分钟）会导致路线优化空间不足，反而推高失败率与成本。选择粒度的经验规则是：<strong>时段长度不应小于单次配送的平均作业时长</strong>。</p>\n<p>预约系统的关键字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;appointment&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;ORD-2026-0926-8891&quot;,&#10;    &quot;zone&quot;: &quot;pudong_north&quot;,&#10;    &quot;window&quot;: { &quot;start&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T09:00:00+08:00&quot;, &quot;end&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T11:00:00+08:00&quot; },&#10;    &quot;window_granularity_h&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;box_model&quot;: &quot;insulated_b_24l&quot;,&#10;    &quot;available_hours&quot;: 13.5,&#10;    &quot;planned_route_hours&quot;: 6.2,&#10;    &quot;reserved&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;reschedule_count&quot;: 0&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"appointment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORD-2026-0926-8891\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"zone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pudong_north\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T09:00:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T11:00:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_granularity_h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"box_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"insulated_b_24l\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"available_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"planned_route_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reserved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reschedule_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>available_hours</code> 与 <code>planned_route_hours</code> 的对比给出了<strong>排班阶段的可行性检查</strong>：前者由保温模型算出，后者由路由引擎算出。<code>reschedule_count</code> 用于识别反复改约的订单，它们往往需要额外的保温准备。</p>\n<p>时间表示应当使用带时区的 ISO 8601 格式。ISO 8601 规定日期时间以 <code>&lt;date&gt;T&lt;time&gt;</code> 组合，时区偏移用 <code>±hh:mm</code> 表示，<code>Z</code> 表示零偏移（UTC）；时长用 <code>PnYnMnDTnHnMnS</code> 或 <code>PnW</code> 表示，区间用斜线分隔（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601\">Wikipedia, ISO 8601</a>）。跨境订单必然跨时区，用本地时间而不用带偏移的格式，会在跨境调度时产生难以排查的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"温控签收的机制\">温控签收的机制</h2><h3 id=\"签收要产生三类证据\">签收要产生三类证据</h3><p>温控签收与普通签收的差别在于，它必须同时记录<strong>时间、温度、责任转移</strong>三件事。</p>\n<p><strong>时间</strong>：交付时刻，精确到足以与温度记录对齐。\n<strong>温度</strong>：签收瞬间的箱内温度，以及整段配送的温度曲线（由箱内记录仪提供）。\n<strong>责任转移</strong>：谁在什么条件下接收了货物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant W as 仓&#10;  participant D as 配送员&#10;  participant C as 客户&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;D: 交付保温箱(带记录仪+变色标签)&#10;  D-&gt;&gt;C: 到达预约时段&#10;  D-&gt;&gt;C: 出示变色标签状态&#10;  alt 标签未变色&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;D: 签收&#10;    D-&gt;&gt;W: 回传签收时刻温度&#10;  else 标签已变色&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;D: 现场拒收/附条件签收&#10;    D-&gt;&gt;W: 触发异常上报&#10;  end&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;W: 归档温度曲线+签收数据\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant W as 仓\n  participant D as 配送员\n  participant C as 客户\n  W-&gt;&gt;D: 交付保温箱(带记录仪+变色标签)\n  D-&gt;&gt;C: 到达预约时段\n  D-&gt;&gt;C: 出示变色标签状态\n  alt 标签未变色\n    C-&gt;&gt;D: 签收\n    D-&gt;&gt;W: 回传签收时刻温度\n  else 标签已变色\n    C-&gt;&gt;D: 现场拒收/附条件签收\n    D-&gt;&gt;W: 触发异常上报\n  end\n  W-&gt;&gt;W: 归档温度曲线+签收数据</pre><h3 id=\"一次性温度指示标签\">一次性温度指示标签</h3><p>温度指示标签的价值在 <a href=\"local-cold-warehouse-turnover\">尾程保温</a> 里已经提到：不可逆变色、无需读数设备、凭肉眼可判。在签收场景里它承担一个特定角色——<strong>让客户成为判定者</strong>。客户不需要理解&quot;累计暴露&quot;或&quot;平均动力学温度&quot;，他只需要看标签有没有变色。</p>\n<p>这带来一个设计上的分工：标签给客户一个<strong>二元判定</strong>（合格/不合格），记录仪给平台一个<strong>连续判定</strong>（用于定责与索赔）。两者不一致时（如标签未变色但记录仪显示曾超温）以记录仪为准，因为标签阈值通常设在比报警阈值更宽的位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拒收与部分接收的处置\">拒收与部分接收的处置</h3><p>当温度判定不合格时，实践中有三种处置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全额拒收</strong>：货物退回，重新补发。适用于高货值或食品安全风险明确的情况。</li>\n<li><strong>附条件签收</strong>：客户接受货物但标记温度异常，平台在事后做检测与赔付。适用于客户实际需求紧急、愿意承担一定风险的情况。</li>\n<li><strong>部分接收</strong>：整批中只有部分箱体异常，只退异常部分。适用于多箱配送。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三种处置的<strong>关键区别在于责任转移的时点</strong>。全额拒收时货物仍在平台责任期；附条件签收时，责任在签收瞬间转移给客户，但平台保留赔付义务。这个区分必须在签收数据里显式记录，否则事后无法判断。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pod_event&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;ORD-2026-0926-8891&quot;,&#10;    &quot;delivered_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T08:47:00+08:00&quot;,&#10;    &quot;acceptance&quot;: &quot;conditional&quot;,&#10;    &quot;temp_at_delivery_c&quot;: 5.3,&#10;    &quot;alarm_threshold_c&quot;: 6.0,&#10;    &quot;indicator_label&quot;: &quot;unchanged&quot;,&#10;    &quot;customer_note&quot;: &quot;包装完好,温度略高但已接受&quot;,&#10;    &quot;liability_transferred_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T08:47:00+08:00&quot;,&#10;    &quot;claim_window_until&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T08:47:00+08:00&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pod_event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORD-2026-0926-8891\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"delivered_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T08:47:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"acceptance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"conditional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"temp_at_delivery_c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"alarm_threshold_c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indicator_label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unchanged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"customer_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"包装完好,温度略高但已接受\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"liability_transferred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T08:47:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"claim_window_until\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-04T08:47:00+08:00\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>acceptance</code> 枚举（<code>full</code> / <code>conditional</code> / <code>partial</code> / <code>rejected</code>）与 <code>liability_transferred_at</code> 的组合，是后续理赔系统的输入。<code>claim_window_until</code> 给出索赔期的终点——生鲜的索赔期通常比标品短得多，因为货已消耗、无法复原检验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"履约质量度量\">履约质量度量</h2><p>时效窗与温控签收的效果要用指标来闭环。三个核心指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预约达成率</strong>：实际到达时间落在预约时段内的比例。它直接反映排班的准确度。</li>\n<li><strong>温控合格率</strong>：签收时温度在阈值内的比例。它反映的是保温方案与实际配送时长的匹配度。</li>\n<li><strong>无效配送率</strong>：因无人在家、地址错误等导致的失败比例。它是尾程超温的主要来源之一。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个指标之间存在制约关系：把时效窗压得很紧，预约达成率会下降；把预约时段切得很细，无效配送率会上升。因此它们必须一起看，单独优化任何一个都会把成本挤到另一个上面。这些指标最终要进入承运商的绩效评价体系，见 <a href=\"../coldchain-waste-ops/coldchain-sla-cost-carrier-kpi\">冷链 SLA 与承运商绩效</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冷链交付要把时间变成三样可管理的东西：<strong>时效窗是承诺、预约是履约机制、温控签收是验证</strong>。</li>\n<li>时效窗是<strong>物理约束</strong>而非营销口径，上限由保温模型的可用配送时长决定，须按季节/区域/箱体分档。</li>\n<li>成本结构反直觉：越快越贵（运力密集），慢件必须配更强保温方案来部分抵消运力成本的节省。</li>\n<li>预约解决配送失败、月台调度、温度预算可预测性三件事；时段粒度不应小于单次配送平均作业时长。</li>\n<li>时间表示用带时区偏移的 ISO 8601 格式，跨境订单用本地时间会产生难排查的错误。</li>\n<li>温控签收要同时产生<strong>时间、温度、责任转移</strong>三类证据；一次性变色标签给客户做二元判定，记录仪给平台做连续判定与定责。</li>\n<li>拒收/附条件签收/部分接收的核心差别是<strong>责任转移时点</strong>，必须显式记录。</li>\n<li>三个履约指标（预约达成率、温控合格率、无效配送率）必须一起看，并进入 <a href=\"../coldchain-waste-ops/coldchain-sla-cost-carrier-kpi\">承运商绩效体系</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时效窗/预约与温控签收","id":"时效窗-预约与温控签收"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时效窗的生成逻辑","id":"时效窗的生成逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"时效窗不是营销口径，是物理约束","id":"时效窗不是营销口径-是物理约束"},{"level":3,"text":"三档时效窗与成本阶梯","id":"三档时效窗与成本阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"预约机制的作用","id":"预约机制的作用"},{"level":3,"text":"预约解决的三个问题","id":"预约解决的三个问题"},{"level":3,"text":"时段粒度与调度代价","id":"时段粒度与调度代价"},{"level":2,"text":"温控签收的机制","id":"温控签收的机制"},{"level":3,"text":"签收要产生三类证据","id":"签收要产生三类证据"},{"level":3,"text":"一次性温度指示标签","id":"一次性温度指示标签"},{"level":3,"text":"拒收与部分接收的处置","id":"拒收与部分接收的处置"},{"level":2,"text":"履约质量度量","id":"履约质量度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"本地冷库周转与冷链尾程保温","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/cold-customs-lastmile/local-cold-warehouse-turnover"},"next":{"title":"超温断链定责与保险（联072/111）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/coldchain-waste-ops/excursion-breach-liability-insurance"}}